condary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Present Continuous Tense - I, You"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about current actions - things that are happening NOW."}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  What are you doing? "}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I am studying."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the verb  <span class=\"strong\">to be</span> and  <span class=\"strong\">verb-ing</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"03\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Subject </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">To be </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb-ing </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"studying.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eating.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To ask a question, use the structure: What are you doing?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking How Much Things Cost"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the phrase \u201cHow much \u2026 ?\u201d to ask the amount of money you have to give when you buy something.</br></br>In a store, you can also ask, \"What's the price of ... ?\""}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Customer</span>: How much is the coffee?<br><span class=\"strong\"> Clerk</span>:  It is $3.50."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Customer</span>: What's the price of this new phone?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Can I help you? "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what a sales clerk asks a customer "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:     Can I help you? <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>:     Yes, one coffee, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a coffee shop."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cappuccino "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "espresso with hot milk and foam"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like a cappuccino for breakfast."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "espresso "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " strong black coffee  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I drink espresso every day. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "medium "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "average size "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I drink a medium coffee every morning."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fresh "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "new "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm making a fresh pot of coffee now."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to order "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask for something in a restaurant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am ordering a coffee."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "juice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "liquid from fruit or vegetables"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  This orange juice is delicious."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glass "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what we use to drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I have a glass of juice please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "water "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " H2O; a clear liquid we drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I have a glass of water, please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le03ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le03ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and a barista."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask how much things cost."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 6 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present the dialogue in class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about ordering a coffee."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what people are doing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask how much things cost."}]}], "type": "sena"}